    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "2. Case diary of the case has been received and Mr. S.S. Pradhan, learned Additional Government Advocate has placed the statements of victim recorded under Section 161 of the Cr.P.C. and 164 of Cr.P.C., where she has stated that she was forcibly taken away by the petitioner and he had sexual relations with her against her wishes.\n3. Mr. N. Pattanaik, learned counsel for the petitioner prays for a short adjournment to enable him to go through the statements of witnesses in order to convince the Court that this is a case of consent and the victim aged about 15 years 7 months has eloped with the petitioner.\n4. List this case on 19.02.2024.",
